================================================================================

SCOPE — what this licence does and does not cover

This licence applies to the SOURCE CODE and DOCUMENTATION in this
repository: the Python modules under core/, screens/, tools/ and main.py,
the JSON configuration and layout files, and the Markdown documents.

It does NOT apply to:

  The base pack — OrionLayer's pictures
      This repository holds no picture (work order 241). OrionLayer's own
      pictures come as the base pack, a separate download that
      basepack.json names file by file. They are pictures by Data (Daniel
      Sattler), licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
      (CC BY 4.0, https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/); the
      pack's own LICENSE.txt carries the licence and its one rule: keep
      the credits. Where a picture redraws artwork of Master of Orion 2:
      Battle at Antares (Simtex / MicroProse, 1996), the copyright in the
      underlying work remains with its rightsholder. OrionLayer needs an
      installed, legally obtained copy of the game and replaces none of
      it.
      Where they came from, as recorded before the pack existed: the
      planet surface sheet
      screens/colony_summary/assets/_src/surfaces/planet_surfaces.png and
      the output-panel icon sheets under
      screens/colony_summary/assets/_src/output/ were generated by the
      maintainer with ChatGPT; so were the HUD,
      assets/shared/hud/galaxy_hud.png, and the galaxy screen mockup
      (kept with the developer's records). The universal background
      assets/shared/backgrounds/universal.png and the gas giant
      screens/galaxy_map/assets/gas_giant.png are the maintainer's
      pictures; how they were made is not recorded. The six ship masters
      screens/galaxy_map/assets/ships/_src/ are the maintainer's own HD
      drawings (work order 243). Before work order 243 this file said no
      copyright was claimed over the AI-generated ones; the maintainer's
      decision of 12 October 2026 puts every picture of the pack under
      CC BY 4.0.

  The leader portraits
      The 67 high-resolution leader portraits (work order 234) are a mod
      for the player's mod folder (files/mods/leader_portraits/), neither
      in this repository nor in the base pack. They are the maintainer's
      redrawings of the game's leader portraits; the copyright in the
      underlying work remains with its rightsholder.

  The display font
      assets/shared/fonts/Aldrich-Regular.ttf is Copyright (c) 2011
      Matthew Desmond (MADType) and is licensed under the SIL Open Font
      License, Version 1.1 — see assets/shared/fonts/OFL.txt.

  Anything extracted at runtime
      Context-help texts (HELP.LBX) and nebula reference sprites
      (STARBG.LBX) are read from the user's own installation by
      tools/help_extract.py and tools/nebula_extract.py. They are not
      part of this repository and are excluded by .gitignore.

OrionLayer requires orion2re, a separate project, to run. It communicates
with it over a local TCP socket and includes no part of it.
